      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_altcriteriaratio"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "fuel",
          "speciation"
        ],
        "note": "60 rows, all fuel type 5 on formulation 27002 for model years 2001-2020: the NUMERATOR of the E85 altTHC scale factor (adjust.rs:625-692). Where a supplied formulation's subtype is 51 or 52 and the model year is 2001 or later, MOVES emits a SECOND fuel block carrying the already-criteria-adjusted rate times `altRatio / ratio` and re-tags it pollutant 10001; `HCSpeciationCalculator` then speciates that block with the E10 subtype's ratios instead of the emission's own, because such vehicles burn E10-like blends in practice. The quotient is 0.99340697 on both of its model-year bands here, and the branch as a whole multiplies the emitted VOC by 3.8528. Same five key columns as `criteriaratio`, and the same GPA blend.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
