        "note": "446 rows: `AirToxicsCalculator`'s ATRatioGas1 path (airtoxics.rs:784-800), the toxic-over-VOC ratio per fuel FORMULATION, over six output pollutant-processes -- 2001, 2101, 2401, 2501, 2601 and 2701. Keyed by (fuelFormulationID, polProcessID) with a model-year window AND an `ageID`, and the age is a join key rather than part of the window: `synthesize_at_ratio` resolves `modelYearID = year - ageID` and keeps the row only when that year is inside [minModelYearID, maxModelYearID]. The two are not redundant -- gasoline model years 1996-2000 take five DIFFERENT ratios out of one window whose other sixteen ages are identical, so a document that matched the window and not the age would be right on 36 of the 41 gasoline cohorts. `monthGroupID` is NOT read: the extract derives its month from the FuelSupply join, which this document already applies as `fsu_matchesRunFuelMonth`.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
