        "note": "650 rows: `AirToxicsCalculator`'s ATRatioNonGas path (airtoxics.rs:833-856), over the same six output pollutant-processes. Keyed by (polProcessID, sourceTypeID, fuelSubtypeID) and by a model-year group written SELF-DESCRIBED in one column -- 19501980, 20072007, 20312050 -- which lib/keys.esm's `model_year_in_group` decodes. It covers diesel (subtypes 20 and 21) at every model year and E85 (51, 52) only to 2000, so this run's E85 cohorts split at 2001: nongas below, ATRatioGas1 above, and no cohort reaches both. The Go APPENDS both paths' emissions rather than choosing between them, so this document sums them. Ethanol (21) is where the sum has live terms on BOTH sides across the run -- 64.756 g through ATRatioGas1 on gasoline and 0.006 g through this path on E85 -- while remaining a sum of one term in every individual cell (docs/chain-so2-co2e-mechanism.md 7.3).",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
