          "description": "zonemonthhour.relHumidity, in PERCENT and not as a fraction -- 90.400001525879 at hour 7. Second argument of the heat-index regression, and read for no other purpose; below 78 degF the regression is not evaluated at all, so on this fixture's own hour the column is ingested and then not used.",
