          ],
          "description": "zonemonthhour.temperature, 59.5 degF at hour 7, and MG-3's first argument. The temperature adjustment reads THIS column and the A/C activity quadratic reads `zmh_heatIndex`; the two are equal on the 17 of this snapshot's 24 hours below 78 degF -- hour 7 among them -- and differ by up to 1.6 degF on the other seven, so the distinction costs nothing at THIS hour and is made because adjust.rs:495-535 makes it.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
