            "fuelformulation_rows"
          ],
          "description": "fuelformulation.sulfurLevel, parts per million by mass. 7.15 on this county's gasoline and E85 formulations and 6.0 on its diesel one; the SQL reads it as `coalesce(sulfurLevel, 0)` and no supplied formulation here is NULL.",
          "update": {
