              },
              {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "pol_process_id",
                "bindings": {
                  "pollutant_id": {
                    "op": "enum",
                    "args": [
                      "pollutant",
                      "TotalEnergyConsumption"
                    ]
                  },
                  "process_id": "rspp_processID"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "The two declarations unioned, and the summed pollutant-processes held out. They are disjoint by construction -- MOVES writes a `runspecchainedto` row for a pollutant-process exactly when a calculator does not carry its input as a constant -- and `run_chainDeclarationOverlap` asserts that. The gate is not cosmetic: 8601 has TWO `runspecchainedto` rows and the aggregate below them would sum 8001 and 501 into 8501.",
          "lhs": "rspp_chainInputPolProcessID",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  1.0,
                  "rspp_isSummed"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  "rspp_declaredChainInputPolProcessID",
                  "rspp_calculatorChainInputPolProcessID"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "run_chainDeclarationOverlap",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "n"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "n": {
                "from": "run_rows"
              },
              "p": {
                "from": "runspecpollutantprocess_rows"
              }
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "ifelse",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "and",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": ">",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": [
                            "rspp_declaredChainInputPolProcessID",
                            "p"
                          ]
                        },
                        0.0
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": ">",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "index",
                          "args": [
                            "rspp_calculatorChainInputPolProcessID",
                            "p"
                          ]
                        },
                        0.0
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                1.0,
                0.0
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_comment": "The chain ROOT, in four steps. MOVES chains a pollutant-process to ANOTHER pollutant-process, and this run chains three levels deep -- 7901 <- 101, 8701 <- 7901, 2001/2401/2501 <- 8701 -- where every earlier fixture chained one. Every ratio in this document scales the ROOT's per-formulation quantity, so the root has to be resolved before any of them can be applied. It is resolved by iterating ONE parent join rather than by widening it, which is the same move docs/esm-conventions.md 30.2's survival rule makes and is why `rt_survives1/2/3` below can reuse the join shape verbatim.",
          "lhs": "rspp_rootAtDepth0",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "ifelse",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": ">",
                "args": [
                  "rspp_chainInputPolProcessID",
                  0.0
                ]
              },
              0.0,
              "rspp_polProcessID"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rspp_rootAtDepth1",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "p"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "p": {
                "from": "runspecpollutantprocess_rows"
              },
              "p2": {
                "from": "runspecpollutantprocess_rows"
              }
            },
            "join": [
              {
                "syms": [
                  "p",
                  "p2"
                ],
                "on": [
                  [
                    "rspp_chainInputPolProcessID",
                    "rspp_polProcessID"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "rspp_rootAtDepth0",
                "p2"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rspp_rootAtDepth2",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "p"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "p": {
                "from": "runspecpollutantprocess_rows"
              },
              "p2": {
                "from": "runspecpollutantprocess_rows"
              }
            },
            "join": [
              {
                "syms": [
                  "p",
                  "p2"
                ],
                "on": [
                  [
                    "rspp_chainInputPolProcessID",
                    "rspp_polProcessID"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "rspp_rootAtDepth1",
                "p2"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "rspp_rootAtDepth3",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "aggregate",
            "args": [],
            "semiring": "sum_product",
            "output_idx": [
              "p"
            ],
            "ranges": {
              "p": {
                "from": "runspecpollutantprocess_rows"
              },
              "p2": {
                "from": "runspecpollutantprocess_rows"
              }
            },
            "join": [
              {
                "syms": [
                  "p",
                  "p2"
                ],
                "on": [
                  [
                    "rspp_chainInputPolProcessID",
                    "rspp_polProcessID"
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ],
            "expr": {
              "op": "index",
              "args": [
                "rspp_rootAtDepth2",
                "p2"
              ]
            }
          }
