        {
          "_comment": "J39, adjust.rs:474-490. Five key pairs and no range predicate at all -- the only lookup in this chain that is a pure equi-join. IT KEYS ON THE CHAIN ROOT, not on the rate row's own pollutant-process: `criteriaratio` carries polProcessID 101 alone, because MOVES applies the criteria fuel effect inside `BaseRateCalculator` to the THC block, and the five speciation calculators downstream inherit it rather than re-deriving it. On the root row itself `rt_rootPolProcessID` is `rt_polProcessID`, so this is the same lookup an unchained fixture writes.",
