          "_comment": "J43. THE E85 altTHC BRANCH (adjust.rs:625-692). For running or start exhaust at model year 2001 or later, MOVES duplicates the THC fuel block of any formulation whose subtype is 51 or 52, scales the copy by `altRatio / ratio` and re-tags it pollutant 10001; `HCSpeciationCalculator` then speciates THAT block into VOC using fuel subtype 12's ratios, while the emitted NMHC still comes from the ordinary block. The branch multiplies the emitted VOC by 3.8528 on the 20 ethanol cohorts of this run that are model year 2001 or later, so it is not a refinement.",
