          "_comment": "adjust.rs:87-142, TWO of its four arms in one document. Electricity energy on running exhaust takes the EV quadratic about 72 degF with a max(., 0) clamp; everything else takes the fall-through quadratic about 75 degF. The PM arm needs pollutant 112 or 118 and the NOx arm pollutant 3, and neither is selected, so `noxhumidityadjust` is populated here and read by nothing.",
